mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>This machine can be used to combine <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Missing%20Piece%20of%20the%20Cube\"><img alt=\"The Missing Piece of the Cube\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/The_Missing_Piece_of_the_Cube_f44676.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Missing%20Piece%20of%20the%20Cube\">The Missing Piece of the Cube</a>, <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Cube\"><img alt=\"The Cube\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/The_Cube_f4a1db.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Cube\">The Cube</a> and a <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Complete%20Opticording%20Sphere\"><img alt=\"Complete Opticording Sphere\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Complete_Opticording_Sphere_625a7f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Complete%20Opticording%20Sphere\">Complete Opticording Sphere</a> into <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Supreme%20Cube\"><img alt=\"The Supreme Cube\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/The_Supreme_Cube_904d64.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Supreme%20Cube\">The Supreme Cube</a>. When all the parts are placed in it, it looks like this:\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Opticording Combinator 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Opticording_Combinator_2_dad580.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span><br/>Part of the <a href=\"#/quest/opticording-sphere-quest\">Opticording Sphere Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Complete%20Opticording%20Sphere\">Complete Opticording Sphere</a></li><li>Functional Objects</li><li>Machines (Objects)</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/opticording-sphere-quest\">Opticording Sphere Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sites\">Sites</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Cube\">The Cube</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Missing%20Piece%20of%20the%20Cube\">The Missing Piece of the Cube</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Supreme%20Cube\">The Supreme Cube</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["opticording-sphere-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"opticording-sphere-quest","quest":"Opticording Sphere Quest","step":"9-2","n":63,"title":"Combinar os três itens","kind":"mention","coords":[]}]}}